WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:02.240
Chaityavandan Vidhi

00:02.480 --> 00:04.720
First, give one Khamsaman

00:10.680 --> 00:12.800
Then, stand and join your hands

00:12.800 --> 00:13.760
in the yoga mudra

00:13.960 --> 00:15.960
Say Iriyavahiyam, Tassa Uttari

00:15.960 --> 00:17.560
and Annatha Sutra

00:17.760 --> 00:19.160
Then, perform 1 Kausagga of 1 Logassa

00:19.160 --> 00:20.480
or 4 Navkar Mantras.

00:21.600 --> 00:23.320
recite ‘Namo Arihantanam’

00:23.320 --> 00:24.640
After completing Kausagga,

00:24.640 --> 00:25.600
with join hands

00:25.600 --> 00:26.640
in the Yoga Mudra,

00:26.840 --> 00:28.280
chant the Logassa Sutra.

00:33.320 --> 00:35.040
Then give 3 Khamasamno.

00:38.160 --> 00:40.480
Icchakaren Sandhisahan Bhagwan,

00:40.480 --> 00:41.640
Chaityavandan Karu ?

00:41.960 --> 00:43.520
seek permission

00:43.920 --> 00:45.120
Then, sitting down

00:45.120 --> 00:48.320
fold the left knee up

00:48.520 --> 00:49.720
in the Yoga Mudra,

00:49.720 --> 00:52.040
recite  Sakal - Kushal - Valli stuti

00:54.360 --> 00:55.960
Then recite the Chaityavandana

00:55.960 --> 00:59.160
If possible, recite Mulnayak Bhgwan
Chaityavandana

01:01.600 --> 01:04.920
then recite Jan Kin Chi Sutra and
Namuthunam Sutra

01:06.800 --> 01:08.800
Then, with both hands joined at the
forehead,

01:08.800 --> 01:10.480
bow in the Mukta Sukti Mudra

01:10.480 --> 01:12.800
and recite the "Javanti Chheiyai Sutra."

01:16.840 --> 01:18.760
then give one Khamsaman

01:21.560 --> 01:23.320
with both hands joined at the
forehead,

01:23.320 --> 01:24.920
bow in the Mukta Sukti Mudra

01:24.920 --> 01:27.160
recite "Javant Kevi Sahu Sutra."

01:28.320 --> 01:29.840
then in Yoga Mudra

01:29.840 --> 01:31.520
Then recite the "Namorhat Sutra"

01:31.520 --> 01:32.240
recite Stavan

01:33.400 --> 01:35.600
or recite the Uvasaggaharam Sutra.

01:37.320 --> 01:39.120
then both hands joined at the
forehead,

01:39.280 --> 01:40.800
bow in the Mukta Sukti Mudra

01:40.880 --> 01:42.320
Recite the "Jai Viray Sutra"

01:42.320 --> 01:44.120
up to the "Aabhavamakhanda."

01:44.280 --> 01:47.400
Then, with your hands lowered in the Yoga
Mudra,

01:47.520 --> 01:50.000
recite "Jai Viray" to the end.

01:50.000 --> 01:51.400
Afterward, stand up

01:51.400 --> 01:52.560
Then, stand up.

01:52.560 --> 01:53.640
in Yoga Mudra

01:53.640 --> 01:55.280
Recite the Arihanta Cheiyanam Sutra

01:57.560 --> 01:59.360
and the Annatha Sutra

02:01.640 --> 02:03.680
Then do the Kaussagg of one Navkar

02:03.880 --> 02:05.680
recite "Namo Arihantaṇam"

02:05.680 --> 02:06.960
After crossing Kausagga,

02:07.160 --> 02:08.240
with join hands

02:08.240 --> 02:09.200
in the Yoga Mudra,

02:09.200 --> 02:11.200
recite 1 Stuti or Thoy

02:14.640 --> 02:16.400
Then give 1 Khamasamno

02:20.920 --> 02:23.680
say "Aviḍhi Asaṭhana Michchhami
Dukkadam,"
